<title>BRAZIL: Brazil weekly soybean and product shipment.</title>
<headline>Brazil weekly soybean and product shipment.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>SGS do Brasil reported the following Brazilian soybean and products shipments in the week ended September 22 compared with the previous week and the corresponding week last year, in tonnes -</p>
<p>    Week ended   Week ended   Week ended</p>
<p> .	  09/22/96     09/15/96     09/24/95</p>
<p> Bean	 38,400	  nil	    9,600</p>
<p> Meal	237,100	292,700	159,600</p>
<p> Oil	  30,300	 21,600	 38,200</p>
</text>
